# Build output and generated WASM artefacts.
#
# NOT a bare `*`. It was one, while 108 files under src/ were tracked anyway —
# so every newly generated ts-rs type was silently untracked, `git add` said
# nothing, and the build broke only in CI with an error naming the file that
# IMPORTED the missing type rather than the type itself. Five media types
# shipped that way.
node_modules/
dist/
# A broken self-referential symlink some tooling leaves behind. Named without a
# trailing slash so the symlink itself matches, not only a directory.
/typescript-client
citadel_internal_service_wasm_client*
